      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horicon%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Horicon hosts the John Deere Horicon Works, where lawn and garden tractors and turf mowers are built.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horicon%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Horicon Historical Society’s Satterly Clark Home showcases Native American artifacts and early settler life.",
